---
{
  title: "ob_short"
}
---
### NAME

    ob_short() - Builds the composite short description for an object.

### SYNOPSIS

    string ob_short( object ob );

### DESCRIPTION

    Builds the composite short description for an object.

    Combines the object's base short with any extra shorts, rendering each
    extra short parenthesized and space-separated after the base. When the
    base short is absent, only the extra shorts are returned; when both are
    absent, an empty string is returned.

### PARAMETERS

    ob  (STD_OBJECT)
        The object whose short description to build.

### RETURN VALUES

    (string) The composite short description, or "" if ob is not an object
    or has nothing to show.
